ce with respect to a specific business goal or strategy. Actual values are evaluated against the target to determine KPI score and status.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="227651">target</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1425532">ലക്‌ഷ്യം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10089_227652_1425532"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">As one aspect of a KPI, the desired level of performance with respect to a specific business goal or strategy. Actual values are evaluated against the target to determine KPI score and status.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="227652">target value</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1425532">ലക്‌ഷ്യം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10091_43116_1241658"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A signal used in serial communications sent, for example, by a computer to its modem to indicate that the computer is ready to accept an incoming transmission.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="43116">data terminal ready</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241658">DTR<