"definition">A graphic or other object that is inserted in the drawing layer so that you can position it precisely on the page or in front of or behind text or other objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232824">floating object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877922">ഫ്ലോട്ടിംഗ് ഒബ്‌ജക്റ്റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10572_24731_1877705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A toolbar that is part of an application when it's installed on your computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="24731">built-in toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877705">ബില്‍റ്റ്-ഇന്‍ ഉപകരണബാര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10573_187711_1241681"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control in the Web Parts control set that inherits directly or indirectly from the System.Web.UI.WebControls.WebParts.Part class and is used to create the primary user interface of Web Parts applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187711">part control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241681">