/termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490733">ക്ലാസ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10909_127144_489724"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A quantity assigned to an element such as a variable, symbol, or label.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="127144">value</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489724">മൂല്യം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1091_187060_1241185"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data type that has a unique characteristic and an identical presentation in memory for both managed and unmanaged environments. It can be directly shared.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187060">blittable type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241185">ബ്ലിറ്റബിള്‍ തരം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10916_338545_490744"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To store data in such a way that it can be retrieved later by the same security support component, and only by that security support component.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338545">seal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490744">സീലുചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10918_20790_2849076"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To measure the performance of something according to specified standards in order to improve it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20790">benchmark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849076">പ്രവർത്തനനിലവാരം അളക്കൂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10928_359996_490837"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A table, query, form, report, macro, or module that remains in the replica or Design Master where it was created. Neither the object nor changes to the object are copied to other members in the replica set.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359996">local object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490837">പ്രാദേശിക ഓബ്ജക്റ്റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10934_237291_490238"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that applies a read-only state to a document inside client applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237291">Mark as Final</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490238">ആത്യന്തികം എന്നു അടയാളപ്പെടുത്തുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10935_54757_489286"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To associate a flag with a message or other item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="54757">flag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489286">ഫ്ലാഗുചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10938_187521_1241697"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A copy of a file stored in a user's working folder on the local computer. The local copy differs from the master copy if the local copy is changed since the last checkout, or if the master copy is changed by another user while the local copy is checked out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187521">local copy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241697">പ്രാദേശിക പ്രതി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10942_187178_1241698"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A warning that is issued due to a compiler problem.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187178">compiler warning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241698">കംപൈലര്‍ മുന്നറിയിപ്പ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10945_139125_1877780"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software program that reduces a file's size for storage on a disk. If a compressed file is too large to fit onto a single disk, the compression utility copies it onto multiple disks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="139125">compression utility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877780">കം‌പ്രഷന്‍ യൂട്ടിലിറ്റി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10947_320488_489377"><l