icalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11744_38453_1961458"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person, inside or outside your organization, for whom you have created an entry where you can save several types of information, such as street and email addresses, telephone and fax numbers, and Web page URLs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="38453">contact</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961458">കോണ്‍ടാക്‍റ്റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11744_38453_489147"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person, inside or outside your organization, for whom you have created an entry where you can save several types of information, such as street and email addresses, telephone and fax numbers, and Web page URLs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="38453">contact</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489147">സമ്പര്‍ക്കം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11748_136786_489784"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A display setting that holds up to 256 specific color entries. Any color palette attached to a picture is by definition an 8-bit palette.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136786">8-bit color</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489784">8-ബിറ്റ് വര്‍ണ്ണം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11755_187613_1241729"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A template that makes it possible to define and encapsulate all of the data regarding a team project. Team Foundation Server uses the methodology information to automatically configure a new team project, including creating the team project Web site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187613">methodology template</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241729">ടെംപ്ലേറ്റ് പ്രവര്‍ത്തനസംവിധാനങ്ങള്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11757_146879_489877"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The device that communicates between your software program and your printer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146879">printer driver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489877">അച്ചടിയന്ത്ര ഡ്രൈവര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11758_153847_489924"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object created with one program and embedded into a document created by another. Embedding the object, rather than simply inserting or pasting it, ensures that the object retains its original format. If you double-click the embedded object, you can edit it with the toolbars and menus from the program used to create it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="153847">embedded object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489924">ഉള്‍പ്പെടുത്തിയ ഓബ്ജക്റ്റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11759_307436_1961109"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The mechanism used to help a caller differentiate between users with names that match the touch-tone or speech input.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307436">Matched Name Selection Method</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961109">പൊരുത്തമുള്ള പേര് തിരഞ്ഞെടുക്കല്‍ രീതി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1176_537723_1241187"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability for languages and classes to exchange information through commonly agreed upon definitions and usage patterns for types.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="537723">type safety</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241187">തര സുരക്ഷ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11763_187892_1241730"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A small panel that is attached to the upper right-hand corner of a .NET control. When the panel is opened, it contains checkboxes and combo boxes that enables developers to select connectivity and other options for the control.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187892">Smart Task</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241730">സ്മാര്‍ട്ട് ചുമതല</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11765_2795839_2800563"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's antimalware solution that provides next generation protection for desktops, portable computers, and servers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795839">Microsoft Defender Antivirus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2800563">Microsof