ize work and make project decisions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="252667">vision statement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241919">വിഷന്‍ പ്രസ്താവന</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1465_536353_1241204"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In ASP.NET, a variable store that is created on the server for the current application and is shared by all users. Application state is typically used to store information that is used for all users, such as application-wide settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="536353">application state</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241204">പ്രയോഗ അവസ്ഥ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14659_141997_1877800"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A detail about a file that helps identify it, such as a descriptive title, the author name, the subject, or a keyword that identifies topics or other important information in the file.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141997">file property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877800">ഫയല്‍ പ്രോപ്പര്‍ട്ടി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14661_132278_1877764"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web hosting and Internet service provider who manages the Web server hardware and software required to make a Web site available on the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="132278">web presence provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877764">വെബ് പ്രസന്‍സ് ദാതാവ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14661_1508998_1877764"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web hosting and Internet service provider who manages the Web server hardware and software required to make a Web site available on the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508998">WPP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877764">വെബ് പ്രസന്‍സ് ദാതാവ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14662_187320_1241920"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A broad Microsoft and industry initiative uniting hardware, softwa