kbook, presentation, or message. The policy defines which Office features are available, which information can be accessed, and what level of editing is allowed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184047">permission policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877869">അനുമതി നയം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14915_35293_489123"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The , character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="35293">comma</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489123">കോമ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14916_293189_490399"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The title of instructions for setting up and preparing the device for first use.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="293189">Getting Started</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490399">പ്രാരംഭ ക്രമം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termE