uch as who created the message and the software used to compose it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="80016">message header</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489460">സന്ദേശ ശീര്‍ഷലേഖം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15_2161198_1961106"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A logical grouping of managed folders. When a managed folder mailbox policy is applied to a user’s mailbox, all the managed folders that are linked to the policy are deployed in a single operation, thereby making the deployment of messaging records management (MRM) easier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2161198">UM mailbox policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961106">മാനേജുചെയ്‌ത ഫോള്‍ഡര്‍ മെയില്‍ബോക്‌സ് നയം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15_397203_1961106"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A logical grouping of managed folders. When a managed folder mailbox policy is applied to a user’s mailbox, all the managed folders that are linked to the policy are deployed in a single operation, thereby making the deployment of messaging records management (MRM) easier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397203">managed folder mailbox policy</term><termNo