ue, the color itself; Saturation, the purity of the color; and Value, the lightness or darkness of a color.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="62684">HSV</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3041665">HSV</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15888_757192_3041665"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A color model used in some graphics programs to define a color by three values: Hue, the color itself; Saturation, the purity of the color; and Value, the lightness or darkness of a color.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="757192">hue-saturation-value</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3041665">HSV</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15891_187317_1241995"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of design tools in Visual Studio 2005 Team Architect Edition that help reduce the complexity of developing and deploying service-oriented applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187317">Distributed System Designer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241995">വിതരണം ചെയ്ത സിസ്റ്റം ഡിസൈനര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15899_127040_1241996"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To compare files on local volumes with their associated data in secondary storage by Remote Storage. Validating files ensures that all the files on the managed volumes point to valid and correct data in remote storage. It also recalculates volume statistics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="127040">validate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241996">സാധൂകരിക്കുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15904_138795_489804"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A range of colors in which each color gradually blends into the next one. For example, a blue ramp gradually blends hues of blue from pure black to pure blue.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="138795">color ramp</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489804">വര്‍ണ്ണരാജി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15921_140658_489830"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains the styles in a presentation, including the type and size of bullets and fonts; placeholder sizes and positions; background design and fill; color schemes; and a slide master and optional title master.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140658">design template</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489830">ഡിസൈന്‍ ടെം‌പ്ലേറ്റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15926_234817_490187"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item on the Control Panel that provides user a comprehensive view over all roamed content, as well as ability to check on the synchronization progress of individual items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234817">Sync Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490187">സമന്വയ സെന്‍റര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15928_140842_1877793"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An animation enhancement that lets you apply effects to a diagram piece by piece; for example, from top to bottom of a pyramid diagram.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140842">diagram effect option</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</t