ent environment before executing your program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="71360">JIT debugging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241218">JIT ഡീബഗ്ഗിംഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1724_71360_1241219"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technique that catches faults that occur while the program is running outside the development environment. You must set this option in the development environment before executing your program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="71360">JIT debugging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241219">സമയത്തിനുമാത്രം ഡീബഗ്ഗിംഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1724_71361_1241218"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technique that catches faults that occur while the program is running outside the development environment. You must set this option in the development environment before executing your program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="71361">just-in-time debugging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241218">JIT ഡീബഗ്ഗിംഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1724_71361_1241219"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technique that catches faults that occur while the program is running outside the development environment. You must set this option in the development environment before executing your program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="71361">just-in-time debugging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241219">സമയത്തിനുമാത്രം ഡീബഗ്ഗിംഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="173_537619_1241100"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The behavior and state that a class provides, which is matched with what a client of that class can expect to hold. A contract is expressed partly by the signatures for all public fields, methods, properties, and events of that class. This is augmented by a description (usually in simple descriptive text) of what each field or property represents, together with what each method does.  In the .NET Framework add-in programming model, a non-versioning interface that defines the methods and specifies the data types for transferring data over the communication pipeline between the host and the add-in. The contract is in the middle of the communication pipeline between the add-in and the host. The contract assembly is loaded into the application domains of both the add-in and the host.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="537619">contract</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241100">കരാറ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1730_36286_1877710"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of search conditions that is used to find data. Comparison criteria can be a series of characters that you want to match, such as "Northwind Traders," or an expression, such as "&gt;300."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36286">comparison criteria</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877710">താരതമ്യം ചെയ്യല്‍ മാനദണ്ഡം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17310_640432_1229823"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To locate text or a specific item on a Web page or in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="640432">find</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1229823">കണ്ടെത്തുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17311_640433_1977082"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The navigation button used to complete and close a wizard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="640433">Finish</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1977082">പൂർത്തിയാക്കുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17312_640434_3144689"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A navigation button used to return to a page from which the user has navigated away via the web browser Back command.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="640434">Forward</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3144689">ഫോർവേഡുചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17321_640444_2855768"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user who does not have a user account or who does not provide a password.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="640444">guest</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855768">അതിഥി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1735_41913_489174"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove part of a document, usually placing it temporarily in memory so that the cut portion can be inserted (pasted) elsewhere.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="41913">cut</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489174">മുറിക്കുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17387_641212_1425555"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container with a set of properties that can be configured to control the organization and format of Web Parts on a Web Part Page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="641212">Web Part zone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1425555">വെബ് പാര്‍ട്ട് മേഖല</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1739_149687_1230027"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A formula that checks whether a given value is valid for a particular field.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149687">validation formula</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1230027">സാധൂകരണസൂത്രവാക്യം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17397_645009_1242125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A character used in a masked control when there is no user input to display.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645009">mask placeholder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242125">മുഖംമൂടി സ്ഥാനസൂചിക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17398_645011_1242126"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A layout style in which adjacent items align against each other as though they were stacked, always taking up the free space in between the items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645011">stack layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242126">സ്റ്റാക്ക് വിതാനം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17399_645012_1242127"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A layout style in which each end of the ToolStrip is the base of a stack, with some items stacked at the head and other items stacked at the tail. Items are stacked from the ends in.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645012">split stack layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242127">വിഭജന സ്റ്റാക്ക് വിതാനം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="174_138672_2725279"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hierarchical organization of media clips that users can create, import, add additional clips collections to, move, or copy clips from one collection into it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="138672">clip collection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2725279">ക്ലിപ്പ് ശേഖരം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1740_231978_1877902"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">For automatic subtotals and worksheet outlines, all rows or columns that summarize detail data. Summary data usually is adjacent to and below the detail data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231978">summary data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877902">സംഗ്രഹ ഡാറ്റ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17400_645013_1242128"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The design-time access point to the Items Collection Editor for a ToolStrip, MenuStrip, ContextMenuStrip, or StatusStrip control.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645013">template node</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242128">ടെംപ്ലേറ്റ് നോഡ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17401_645014_1242129"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of data binding in which a data-bound control retrieves only as many rows from the database as the user will be able to see on the screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645014">virtual-mode data binding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242129">അയഥാര്‍ഥ സമ്പ്രദായ ഡാറ്റാ ബൈന്‍ഡിംഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17402_645015_1242130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A way of designing a form in which all elements are positioned one immediately after the other.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645015">flow layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242130">ഒഴുക്ക് വിതാനം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17405_645096_1242131"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of event that is generated after a series of events of another type have occurred. An aggregate event is used to represent a series of events to avoid flooding the event consumer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645096">aggregate event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242131">സമുച്ചയ ഇവെന്‍റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17406_645097_1242132"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A recipient of notifications that report an occurrence of an event. An event consumer is either temporary or permanent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645097">event consumer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242132">ഇവെന്‍റ് ഉപഭോക്താവ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17407_645098_1242133"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A provider that determines which permanent event consumer handles a given event.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645098">event consumer provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242133">ഇവെന്‍റ് ഉപഭോക്തൃ ദാതാവ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17408_645099_1242134"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A filter that registers to receive notification of a specific type of event.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645099">event filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242134">ഇവെന്‍റ് അരിപ്പ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17409_645100_1242135"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A WMI Query Language statement that event consumers use to register to receive notification of specific events. An event provider uses an event query to register to generate notifications of specific events.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645100">event query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242135">ഇവെന്‍റ് അന്വേഷണം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1741_128742_2590833"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Teleconferencing in which video images are transmitted among the various geographically separated participants in a meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="128742">video conferencing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590833">വീഡിയോ കോൺഫറൻസിംഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17410_645101_1242136"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A design pattern that uses events to expose asynchronous features of a class.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645101">event-based asynchronous pattern</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242136">ഇവെന്‍റ് ആധാരമാക്കിയുള്ള സമയബന്ധിതമല്ലാത്ത മാതൃക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17411_645104_1242137"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Software or an algorithm that converts images to a specified file format (encoder) or from file format to displayed image (decoder).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645104">image codec</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242137">ഇമേജ് codec</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17411_645104_1242138"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Software or an algorithm that converts images to a specified file format (encoder) or from file format to displayed image (decoder).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645104">image codec</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242138">ഇമേജ് എന്‍കോഡര്‍/ഡീകോഡര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17411_645105_1242137"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Software or an algorithm that converts images to a specified file format (encoder) or from file format to displayed image (decoder).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645105">image encoder/decoder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242137">ഇമേജ് codec</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17411_645105_1242138"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Software or an algorithm that converts images to a specified file format (encoder) or from file format to displayed image (decoder).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645105">image encoder/decoder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242138">ഇമേജ് എന്‍കോഡര്‍/ഡീകോഡര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17412_645106_1242139"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A provider hosted in a separate process from WMI. Decoupled providers are the recommended way to instrument an application because the provider can control its own lifetime instead of being launched every time a user accesses the provider through WMI.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645106">decoupled provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1242139">ഡീകപ്പിള്‍ഡ് ദാതാവ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17419_645117_1425556"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of reusable settings that describes the shared attributes and behaviors of a list item, a document, or a folder.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645117">content type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1425556">ഉള്ളടക്ക തരം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17422_645120_1878011"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Stored on a server or client computer that is configured to control access to content by using information rights management (IRM) technology.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645120">rights-managed</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878011">അവകാശം നിയന്ത്രിച്ച</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1744_27670_1241220"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Descriptive text that is associated with a piece of content, such as an image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="27670">caption</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241220">തലവാചക പാഠം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</term