 objects. The constructor must have the same name as the class itself and must not return a value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="38372">constructor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241221">നിര്‍മ്മാതാവ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17478_648477_1878012"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The folder where junk email is delivered.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="648477">junk e-mail folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878012">ജങ്ക് ഇ-മെയില്‍ ഫോള്‍ഡര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17482_648543_1961189"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email message that is automatically sent by Microsoft Exchange to the owners of a mailbox or a public folder when a size limit, which is called a storage quota, for the mailbox or public folder has been exceeded or is at risk of being exceeded.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="648543">quota message</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961189">ക്വാട്ട സന്ദേശം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote