 of memory still in use may be moved to consolidate the free memory into larger blocks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="57862">GC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241242">GC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23766_1089518_2768773"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A computer, either physical or virtual, capable of processing information to produce a desired result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1089518">machine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2768773">മെഷീൻ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2378_17347_1960907"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to, or characteristic of, a DNS server that hosts a primary or secondary copy of a DNS zone. When a DNS server is configured to host a zone, it is said to be authoritative for names within that zone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="17347">authoritative server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1960907">ആധികാരിക സെര്‍വര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="238_41773_1960964"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Exchange 5.5 and earlier, a custom recipient is a user who is not hosted by Exchange. In Exchange 2003, such users can be added to Active Directory as contacts, Windows users, or users whose Windows accounts are disabled. In any case, they are mail-enabled, but not mailbox-enabled, because their mailboxes are hosted on another messaging system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="41773">custom recipient</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1960964">കസ്റ്റം സ്വീകര്‍ത്താവ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2382_231960_1877893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of summarizing values in the data area of a PivotTable report by using the values in other cells in the data area. Use the Show data as list on the PivotTable Field dialog for a data field to create custom calculations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231960">custom calculation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877893">ഇഷ്‌ടാനുസൃത കാല്‍ക്കുലേഷന്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23840_1091236_1229590"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A video clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091236">embedded video clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1229590">ഉള്‍പ്പെടുത്തിയ വീഡിയോ ക്ലിപ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23841_1091237_1229591"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091237">embedded audio clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1229591">ഉള്‍പ്പെടുത്തിയഓഡിയോ ക്ലിപ്പ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23841_1091237_1413430"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091237">embedded audio clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1413430">ഉള്‍പ്പെടുത്തിയ ഓഡിയോ ക്ലിപ്പ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23864_1091326_1971333"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A standard control that resembles a notebook and lets the user navigate different sections of information without leaving the current element on the screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091326">tab control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1971333">ടാബ് നിയന്ത്രണം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23869_1091332_2818335"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In mathematics, an item that is multiplied in a multiplication problem; for example, 2 and 3 are factors in the problem 2 x 3. The prime factors of a number are a set of prime numbers that, when multiplied together, produce the number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091332">factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818335">ഘടകം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23871_1091334_2290124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ability to view data or navigate to or within a physical or virtual computer environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091334">access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290124">ആക്സസ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23872_1091335_2290139"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account holder who is a family member, but not a parent, and who has limited use of the Internet. Children can view their own settings, but they can't change them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091335">child</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290139">കുട്ടി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23873_1091336_2952161"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account holder who is a parent or a child.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091336">family member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2952161">കുടുംബാംഗം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23874_1091337_2290144"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account holder who is the primary administrator (parent) and the family members they manage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091337">family</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290144">കുടുംബം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23875_1091338_1229592"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To combine thereby increasing the quantity or size of something.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091338">add</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1229592">ചേ൪ക്കുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23876_1091339_2290153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To adjust the action or aspects of a group of items, typically done more than once.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091339">manage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290153">മാനേജ് ചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termN