type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24108_1098542_1427462"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A script-based applet that is stored as a favorite or bookmark in a web browser, or is accessed through a hyperlink on a webpage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098542">bookmarklet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1427462">ബുക്ക്‌മാര്‍ക്ക്‌ലെറ്റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24124_1098902_2686336"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The transfer of certain properties, such as open files, from a parent program or process to another program or process that the parent causes to run.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098902">inheritance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686336">പിന്തുടരൽ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24138_1098950_1265301"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The link to the form where a user can report violations of the terms of use. Contextually, it's understood that the abuse in question is poor conduct, such as obscene language or threats.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098950">Report Abuse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1265301">ദുരുപയോഗം റിപ്പോര്‍ട്ട് ചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24142_1098959_2513833"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A code that grants rights to an individual, for example to use a system or access stored data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098959">authorization code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513833">അധികാരപ്പെടുത്തൽ കോഡ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24145_1103189_1358835"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An available button for Windows Live Toolbar that highlights, in color, search words on the search results page. It also highlights the search words on the websites included in the search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1103189">Highlight Viewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358835">ഹൈലൈറ്റ് വ്യൂവര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24196_1115313_2855765"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A program or program module that adds functionality to or extends the effectiveness of a program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115313">extension</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855765">വിപുലീകരണം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24197_1115314_2513838"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text-based, data interchange format that is used to transmit structured data, typically in Ajax Web applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115314">JavaScript Object Notation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513838">JavaScript ഓബ്‌ജക്‌റ്റ് വ്യാഖ്യാനം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24197_1115314_2513839"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text-based, data interchange format that is used to transmit structured data, typically in Ajax Web applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115314">JavaScript Object Notation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513839">JSON</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24197_1115315_2513838"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text-based, data interchange format that is used to transmit structured data, typically in Ajax Web applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115315">JSON</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513838">JavaScript ഓബ്‌ജക്‌റ്റ് വ്യാഖ്യാനം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24197_1115315_2513839"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text-based, data interchange format that is used to transmit structured data, typically in Ajax Web applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115315">JSON</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513839">JSON</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2420_308318_490493"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The date after which information or a resource is no longer valid.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="308318">expiration date</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490493">കാലഹരണ തീയതി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24202_1115320_1878171"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process, thread, or set of related processes or threads that requires significant system resources or time, or requires exclusive access to large amounts of data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115320">resource-intensive task</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878171">ഉറവിട ഇന്‍റന്‍സീവ് ടാസ്‌ക്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24212_1119987_1878175"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom solution that can be deployed to a site by a site collection administrator, without approval from the farm administrator. Without that approval, the solution has full access to the immediate site and restricted access to system resources and other sites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1119987">sandboxed solution</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878175">സാന്‍‌ഡ്‌ബോക്‌സുചെയ്‌ത പരിഹാരം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24216_1115334_1878172"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom keyword or description and shortcut to a Web page or item on a SharePoint site or the Internet. All of these tags can be viewed, managed, and shared by using My Site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115334">social tag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878172">സോഷ്യല്‍ ടാഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24217_1115335_1878173"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of features that can be used to store and share comments, shortcuts, descriptions, and other information about Web pages and items on a SharePoint site or the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115335">social data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878173">സോഷ്യല്‍ ഡാറ്റ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24224_1115342_1878174"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistic that indicates the degree to which a computer, server farm, or server cluster meets usage demands for that configuration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1115342">quality-of-service indicator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878174">സേവന ഗുണമേന്മയുടെ സൂചകം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24245_1117153_2290142"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An installation package that the user downloads from http://download.live.com/?mkt=en-us.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1117153">download</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290142">ഡൗൺലോഡ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24246_1117154_1369508"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The software that installs the Windows Live software someone selects on the installation webpage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1117154">Windows Live installer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1369508">Windows Live installer</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24247_1117155_1358976"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The main landing or start page on Windows Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1117155">Windows Live Home</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358976">Windows Live Home</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24249_1117156_1358854"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A function that enables a user to make a call to a phone, as opposed to calling another computer or using a webcam.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1117156">phone call</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358854">ഫോണ്‍ വിളി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2425_34681_489115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A predefined set of harmonized colors that you can apply to text and objects. Text and objects with an applied scheme color will change automatically when you switch to a new color scheme or modify the current color scheme.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="34681">color scheme</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489115">വര്‍ണ്ണ സ്കീം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24254_1117166_2855761"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A device that connects networks using the same communications protocols so that information can be passed from one to the other.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1117166">bridge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855761">ബ്രിഡ്‌ജ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24284_1119138_2387714"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user-defined and annotated group of points of interest on a map.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1119138">collection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2387714">ശേഖരം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24287_1119142_1358906"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button next to a search box that someone clicks to search for something.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1119142">Search button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358906">തിരയല്‍ ബട്ടണ്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24288_1119143_1358910"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that displays a thumbnail preview next to each search result. Pointing to the preview enlarges it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1119143">search preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358910">തിരയല്‍ പ്രിവ്യൂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24304_1119174_2726924"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The shared service that securely stores credential sets for external data sources and associates those credential sets to identities of individuals or to group identities. This service can be used to support a variety of solutions. For example, the stored credentials can be leveraged by certain applications to enable single sign-on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1119174">Secure Store Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726924">സുരക്ഷിത സ്‌റ്റോര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24304_1162515_2726924"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The shared service that securely stores credential sets for external data sources and associates those credential sets to identities of individuals or to group identities. This service can be used to support a variety of solutions. For example, the stored credentials can be leveraged by certain applications to enable single sign-on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1162515">SSS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726924">സുരക്ഷിത സ്‌റ്റോര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24304_2717982_2726924"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The shared service that securely stores credential sets for external data sources and associates those credential sets to identities of individuals or to group identities. This service can be used to support a variety of solutions. For example, the stored credentials can be leveraged by certain applications to enable single sign-on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2717982">Secure Store</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig>