 the information to be scrolled by defined increments when the user clicks it. The direction of the arrow indicates the direction in which the information scrolls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="179727">scroll arrow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489998">സ്ക്രോള്‍ അമ്പ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29420_1507690_1878261"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Office Web Component that provides interactive charting functionality on a Web page. You can illustrate data in a chart and give users the ability to change data, change chart options, and see changes reflected in the chart.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507690">Chart Component</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878261">ചാര്‍ട്ട് ഘടകഭാഗം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29429_1508178_1878262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A character that is part of the set that makes up a particular language, such as vowels and consonants.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508178">strong character</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="m