ist is stored in the web.config file for the server farm.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508557">SafeControl list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878265">SafeControl ലിസ്റ്റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29455_1508759_1878266"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A measure whose value is calculated at run time by using an expression.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508759">calculated measure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878266">കണക്കാക്കിയ അളവ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29459_1508807_1878267"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The folder in which various translated files are stored. Each language has a different subfolder that corresponds to its locale identification number (LCID). For example, in a U.S. English installation, the LCID is 1033.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508807">language folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878267">ഭാഷ ഫോള്‍ഡര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29462_1508810_1878268"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A toolbar with buttons and options used to apply text formatting. To display the toolbar, point to Toolbars on the View menu, and then click Formatting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508810">Formatting toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878268">ഫോര്‍മാറ്റിംഗ് ഉപകരണബാര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29464_1508812_1878269"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Visual Basic identifier that's defined in the host application or by using the #Const compiler directive, and used by other compiler directives to determine when or if certain blocks of code are compiled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508812">conditional compiler constant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878269">കണ്ടീഷണല്‍ കം‌പൈലര്‍ കോണ്‍‌സ്റ്റന്‍റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29465_1508813_1878270"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Naskh script that enriches the display of Arabic text. This script uses object linking and embedding (OLE) to create and add objects to a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508813">DecoType Naskh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878270">DecoType Naskh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29466_1508814_1878271"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Ruq'ah script that enriches the display of Arabic text. This script uses object linking and embedding (OLE) to create and add objects to a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508814">DecoType Ruq'ah</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878271">DecoType Ruq'ah</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29473_1508823_1878272"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An administrative tool that examines a computer, server farm, or server cluster and provides statistics that indicate the degree to which the configuration meets expected demands.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508823">health analyzer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878272">ഹെല്‍ത്ത് 