rtner of a contact. Detail that can be added to a contact’s profile, listed under "other."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1510091">significant other</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1652008">മറ്റ് പ്രമുഖര്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29757_1510112_2198601"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that appears during an active phone call, allowing a user to add another person to his/her conference call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1510112">add call</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2198601">കോൾ ചേർക്കുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29760_1510117_2196224"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text string displayed in the status bar for Call Progress, alternating with the callee's name, to prompt the user that he/she can tap the bar to return to the call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1510117">tap to expand</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2196224">വിപുലമാക്കുന്നതിന് സ്പർശിക്കുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsa