ion Service to an app running on Windows Phone. The format and meaning of the data is determined by the app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1612764">raw notification</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1641752">അസംസ്കൃത അറിയിപ്പ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31699_1612765_1775621"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To purchase an app just before downloading and installing it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1612765">purchase at download</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1775621">വാങ്ങി ഡൌണ്‍ലോഡ് ചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="317_141659_1228901"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An XML vocabulary that is used to transform XML data to another form, such as HTML, by means of a style sheet that defines presentation rules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141659">Extensible Stylesheet Language</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1228901">എക്സ്റ്റന്‍സിബിള്‍ സ്റ്റൈല്‍ഷീറ്റ് ലാംഗ്വേജ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partO