ction that is counted and analyzed by the recommendations algorithm in the Analytics Service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676150">usage event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878469">ഉപയോഗ ഇവന്‍റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32417_1676974_1878470"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A metadata navigation control that enables users to limit the items displayed in a list or library to those that match selected values.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676974">Key Filters</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1878470">കീ ഫില്‍ട്ടറുകള്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32431_1678780_1878471"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows for preservation of content documents, pages, and messages in Exchange and SharePoint so that when they are modified or deleted, the original version can still be accessed for electronic discovery and other legal purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678780">In-Place Hold</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term i