 in the Clock app that allows the user to input any time and see it converted to the equivalent time in another time zone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113982">Compare</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2180200">താരതമ്യ സമയം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37265_2113985_2180203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To automatically correct and improve the user's photos with adjustments to color, contrast, red eye, straightening, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2113985">enhance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2180203">മെച്ചപ്പെടുത്തുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37266_2114005_2192658"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab in a file or folder Properties dialog box that allows the user to set, view, change, or remove file and folder permissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2114005">Security tab</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2192658">സുരക്ഷാ ടാബ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37267_2114067_2192636"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section of the Store that contains a selection of products presented to the customer in a group. The products may be purchased individually.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2114067">Collections</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2192636">ശേഖരണങ്ങൾ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37268_2114068_2161086"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section of the Store that includes the top apps, games, movies, and TV charts (Free, Paid, New and rising, Grossing, and Best rated).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2114068">Top charts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2161086">മുൻനിര ചാർട്ടുകൾ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37269_2114069_2192633"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section of the Store that shows subgroups of apps and games, grouped by intended use or function.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term i