cking attacks in which a person with no authorization accesses a network and stays there undetected for a long period of time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370577">advanced persistent threat</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054557">നവീന നിരന്തര ഭീഷണി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41879_2370577_3054559"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of computer hacking attacks in which a person with no authorization accesses a network and stays there undetected for a long period of time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370577">advanced persistent threat</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054559">APT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41879_2370578_3054557"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of computer hacking attacks in which a person with no authorization accesses a network and stays there undetected for a long period of time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370578">APT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054557">നവീന നിരന്തര ഭീഷണി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</ter