 type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42393_2397415_2405609"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Word Mobile tab that allows users to choose the color, thickness, and style that they want their ink to appear as.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397415">Draw</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2405609">വരയ്‌ക്കുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42394_2397416_2405612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The PowerPoint Designer feature that scans users' text for well-defined structures, such as timelines or processes, and converts them to visual representations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397416">Text to SmartArt</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2405612">ടെക്‌സ്‌റ്റ് ടു SmartArt</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4240_152004_489916"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol within TCP/IP that governs the breakup of data messages into packets to be sent via IP, and the reassembly and verif