</termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43044_2438784_2441225"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The drawing app you can use to create simple or elaborate drawings. These drawings can be either black-and-white or color. You can also use Paint to work with pictures, such as .jpg, .gif, or .bmp files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438784">Paint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2441225">Microsoft പെയിന്‍റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43044_2438784_2441226"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The drawing app you can use to create simple or elaborate drawings. These drawings can be either black-and-white or color. You can also use Paint to work with pictures, such as .jpg, .gif, or .bmp files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438784">Paint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2441226">പെയിന്‍റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43053_2439180_2441227"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A bar, appearing at the top, that displays a small preview image (thumbnail) of the content in each open tab.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2439180">preview bar</ter