n be viewed in the Test Results window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237252">pending test</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241330">ബാക്കിയായ പരിശോധന</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44290_2488792_2493917"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The field in Outlook Customer Manager that holds the negotiable amount the provider will receive for a deal and which is finalized once the deal is closed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488792">Deal amount</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493917">ഡീൽ തുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44291_2488793_2493919"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The field in Outlook Customer Manager that records the number of deals that did not go through as well as their sum.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488793">Deals lost</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493919">നഷ്‌ടമായ ഡീലുകൾ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44292_2488794_2493920"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The field in Outlook Customer Manager that records the number of deals that were accepted and completed as well as their sum.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488794">Deals won</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493920">നേടിയ ഡീലുകൾ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44293_2488795_2493924"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The field in Outlook Customer Manager that records the number of deals have not been finalized (won or lost), as well as their sum.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488795">Deals active</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493924">സജീവ ഡീലുകൾ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="443_17176_1241128"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security feature of Microsoft Internet Explorer. Authenticode allows vendors of downloadable executable code (plug-ins or ActiveX controls, for example) to attach digital certificates to their products to assure end users that the code is from the original developer and has not been altered. Authenticode lets end users decide for themselves whether to accept or reject software components posted on the Internet before downloading begins.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="17176">Authenticode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241128">പ്രാമാണിക കോഡ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44315_2489135_2493922"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for students and educators that includes the Universal Windows Platform versions of Excel, PowerPoint, and Word, and that allows shared computer activation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489135">Office 365 Education Cart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493922">Office 365 എജ്യുക്കേഷൻ കാർട്ട്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44329_2489211_2590056"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application available on devices you manage with Intune which is used to access company data to perform common tasks like enrolling devices, installing apps, and locating information for assistance from your IT department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489211">Intune Company Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590056">Intune Company Portal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44329_2489211_2590120"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application available on devices you manage with Intune which is used to access company data to perform common tasks like enrolling devices, installing apps, and locating information for assistance from your IT department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489211">Intune Company Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590120">Company Portal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44329_2490036_2590056"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application available on devices you manage with Intune which is used to access company data to perform common tasks like enrolling devices, installing apps, and locating information for assistance from your IT department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490036">Company Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590056">Intune Company Portal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44329_2490036_2590120"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application available on devices you manage with Intune which is used to access company data to perform common tasks like enrolling devices, installing apps, and locating information for assistance from your IT department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490036">Company Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590120">Company Portal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44349_2490693_2500321"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to select a later time to automatically deliver emails and where said emails are stored in the Drafts folder until the time selected for sending.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490693">Send Later</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500321">പിന്നീട് അയയ്‌ക്കുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44350_2490694_2503356"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The value that Excel returns when a formula returns an array of values and one or more of the cells it would spill to already has content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490694">#NOSPILL!</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503356">#NOSPILL!</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44351_2490695_2500319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The value that Excel returns when a function tried to connect to a network resource or a remote service but failed.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490695">#CONNECT!</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500319">#CONNECT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44351_2490695_2503354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The value that Excel returns when a function tried to connect to a network resource or a remote service but failed.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490695">#CONNECT!</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503354">#CONNECT!</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44352_2490696_2503355"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel cell capability that allows a cell to place array values in neighboring blank cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2490696">Spill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2503355">സ്‌പിൽ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44355_2493977_2513517"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for a collection of configuration settings file with extension .ppkg. Provisioning packages are simple enough that with a short set of written instructions, a student or non-technical employee can use them to configure their device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493977">provisioning package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513517">പ്രൊവിഷനിംഗ് പാക്കേജ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44356_2493981_2513520"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The academic disciplines of science, technology, engineering and mathematics, used when addressing education policy and curriculum choices in schools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493981">STEM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513520">STEM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44357_2493985_2513515"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collaborative work space, tool, app, or program for making, learning, exploring and sharing. It can refer to a literal space or place, or to digital environments where people are encouraged to create and share with a community.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493985">makerspace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513515">മാർക്കർസ്പേസ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44358_2493987_2513512"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A test with important consequences for the test taker or which is the basis of a major decision.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493987">high-stakes testing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513512">ഹൈ-സ്റ്റേക്ക് ടെസ്റ്റിംഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44360_2496992_2504325"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The portal where admins in educational institutions can acquire and distribute apps for their students, faculty, and staff to use.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2496992">Microsoft Store for Education</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2504325">വിദ്യാഭ്യാസത്തിനായുള്ള Microsoft Store</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44377_2499540_2501678"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Chrome browser extension that allows users to easily view, attach, and share their OneDrive files to anyone with Gmail.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499540">Project Copenhagen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501678">Project Copenhagen</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44378_2499542_2501679"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The PowerPoint plugin that allows users to post their slides as images, videos, 