A worker who serves as the first point of contact between companies, their customers, products, suppliers and the market and who often directly impact the customer experience and the delivery and development of products and services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2911839">frontline worker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2912993">ഫ്രന്‍റ്‌ലൈൻ വർക്കർ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45100_2544667_2545412"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to use a digital pen and make the strokes appear in pencil texture.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2544667">Digital Pencil</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2545412">ഡിജിറ്റൽ പെൻസിൽ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45101_2544668_2545414"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ink type that looks like pencil strokes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2544668">pencil texture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2545414">പെൻസിൽ ടെക്‌സ്‌ചർ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote