omers to store their users’ Office 365 data in specific Office 365 geographical locations to fulfill regulatory data residency requirements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2551936">Multi-Geo Capabilities</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2556757">Multi-Geo Capabilities</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45210_2551936_2666013"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows customers to store their users’ Office 365 data in specific Office 365 geographical locations to fulfill regulatory data residency requirements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2551936">Multi-Geo Capabilities</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2666013">Multi-Geo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45210_2551936_2761771"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows customers to store their users’ Office 365 data in specific Office 365 geographical locations to fulfill regulatory data residency requirements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2551936">Multi-Geo Capabilities</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp><