rs or longer) free of appointments or meetings intended to be used by employees to focus on tasks outside of meetings, emails, chats, and calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652282">focus time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2910595">ഫോക്കസ് സമയം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47075_2652308_2654923"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An environment where software is put into operation for their intended uses by end users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652308">production environment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2654923">നിർമ്മാണ പരിതസ്ഥിതി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47076_2652448_2652908"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Skype that allows a user to start a group call automatically without ringing anyone, only by displaying a notification, through which the rest of users of the group can join the call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652448">Go Live</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652908">ഗോ ലൈവ്</term><termN