 individual video feed for all attendees in a Teams meeting regardless of who is currently talking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2897500">spotlight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2897758">സ്പോട്ട്‌ലൈറ്റ് ചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51447_2898061_2898268"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox subscription service through which users can pay a monthly fee towards the purchase of an Xbox console plus Xbox Game Pass Ultimate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898061">Xbox All Access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898268">Xbox All Access</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51491_2898943_2899044"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows app that helps users assess the current state of their device on dimensions like battery life, storage, and updates and recommends ways to improve the device's performance or compare with the performance of a new PC.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898943">Windows PC Health Check</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lan