er, usually denoted with i, that is defined by i2=-1.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956732">imaginary unit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2990069">സാങ്കൽപ്പിക ഏകകം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52753_2956733_2990070"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of a complex number a+bi, where a and b are real numbers, the value b.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956733">imaginary part</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2990070">സാങ്കൽപ്പിക ഘടകം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52754_2956734_2956875"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A function whose derivative is a given function, an indefinite integral.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956734">antiderivative</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956875">ആന്‍റിഡിറൈവേറ്റീവ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52755_2956735_2990063"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An identity that expresses the Pythagorean theorem in terms of trigonometric functions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956735">Pythagorean Identity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2990063">പൈത്തഗോറിയൻ ഐഡന്‍റിറ്റി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52756_2956736_2990058"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mnemonic device for computing the determinant of a 3x3 matrix named after the French mathematician Pierre Frédéric Sarrus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956736">Sarrus' Rule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2990058">സറൂസിന്‍റെ നിയമം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52757_2956737_2990083"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">For a polynomial sorted by degree, the last monomial term.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956737">trailing term</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2990083">പിൻ പദം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52758_2956738_2990084"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A way of representing repeated multiplications of the same number by writing the number as a base with the number of repeats written as a small number to its upper right.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956738">exponential form</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2990084">കൃത്യങ്ക രൂപം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52759_2956739_2990061"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mathematical root expressed with a radical sign, generally a square root or cube root.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956739">radical form</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2990061">മൂല രൂപം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52760_2956740_2990064"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The capability that gives the user instantaneous access to a device by using a remote shell connection, granting them the power to do in-depth investigative work and take immediate response actions to promptly contain identified threats in real time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2956740">Live Response</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2990064">തത്സമയ പ്രതികരണം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52773_2997773_2997824"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Information Excel function that returns TRUE if the value is any error value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2997773">ISERROR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2997824">ISERROR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52774_2997860_2998356"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Microsoft Edge that allows the user to keep track of their ideas on the web by adding pages, images, links, or text to a nameable collection that can be saved and synced across signed-in devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2997860">Collections</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2998356">ശേഖരങ്ങൾ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52775_2997861_2998355"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of pages, notes, images, or other content saved by the user in the Collections feature in Microsoft Edge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2997861">collection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2998355">ശേഖരം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52776_2997862_2998373"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">SDK for developers to leverage features and capabilities that are part of the core OS code.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2997862">Windows Platform SDK</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2998373">Windows Platform SDK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52777_2997863_2998370"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">SDK for developers to leverage features and capabilities that have been decoupled from the core OS code.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2997863">Windows App SDK</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN