s, identify the amount and types of personal data being transferred, and take actions to remediate risks, such as applying additional encryption or restricting access for the data being transferred.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031831">cross-border transfers</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031901">ക്രോസ്‌-ബോർഡർ കൈമാറ്റങ്ങൾ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53221_3031832_3031898"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A transfer of personal data across a geographic border (such as country or regional borders).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031832">cross-border transfer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031898">ക്രോസ്‌-ബോർഡർ കൈമാറ്റം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53222_3031833_3031909"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A policy template that helps detect personal data with external, excessive, and idle access and trigger remediation actions including sending notifications to the data or site owners to remove unnecessary accesses.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031833">data overexposure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></la