inter, or asset, in a space plan.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237928">space</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1425513">സ്ഥലം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53611_3052168_3052544"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Outlook that empowers individuals to set up personal appointment booking pages to eliminate the back-and-forth of scheduling 1:1 meetings while still maintaining control of their calendar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052168">Bookings with me</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052544">എന്നോടൊപ്പമുള്ള Bookings</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53612_3052180_3052551"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app in Microsoft Teams that allows organizations to create basic check-in forms for a range of processes (end of shift, store evaluations, recurring action items) based off out-of-the-box tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052180">Updates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052551">അപ്‍ഡേറ്റുകൾ</term><termNote 