 type a prompt and have your images combined and reimagined, generating an image with a new style.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161613">restyle image</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162967">റീസ്‌റ്റൈൽ ഇമേജ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5624_1517462_2720066"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A window that is displayed when users are participating in a virtual conversation and that displays a list of participants, the conversation content, and the commands and controls for managing the conversation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1517462">instant messaging window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2720066">സംഭാഷണ വിൻഡോ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5624_418623_2720066"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A window that is displayed when users are participating in a virtual conversation and that displays a list of participants, the conversation content, and the commands and controls for managing the conversation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="418623">conversation window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></