r</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6479_397215_1961267"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains a record of the changes that were made to a database. All changes to the database are recorded in the transaction log files before they are written into the database files. If a database shuts down unexpectedly, unfinished transactions can be restored by replaying the transaction log files into the database.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397215">transaction log file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961267">ട്രാന്‍സാക്ഷന്‍ ലോഗ് ഫയല്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="648_234820_490188"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that gives a general indication of the performance capability of your computer's hardware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234820">system rating</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490188">സിസ്റ്റം റേറ്റിംഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6484_136942_1944514"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A ready-made button that the user can insert into his/her presentation and define hyperlinks for.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136942">action button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944514">ആക്ഷന്‍ ബട്ടണ്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6486_310254_490513"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity at one end of a point-to-point LAN/WLAN segment that is requesting authenticated access to the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="310254">supplicant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490513">സപ്ലിക്കന്‍റ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6490_183384_2180192"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An agreement between two owners to promote content in different places.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183384">affiliate marketing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2180192">അഫിലിയേറ്റ് മാർക്കറ്റിംഗ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6491_251786_1241146"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The site used to store and present non-code work products and reports for a team project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="251786">project portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241146">പ്രോജക്റ്റ് കവാടം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6502_315144_490548"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A word, symbol, or other group of characters used to identify a file, a storage medium, an element defined in a computer program, or a specific item in a document such as a spreadsheet or a chart.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="315144">label</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490548">ലേബല്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6507_130126_489736"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of measures to protect a machine from being infected by a virus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="130126">virus protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489736">വൈറസ് പരിരക്ഷണം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termN