 users' mailboxes to control the retention and journaling of messages for messaging records management (MRM). Managed content settings define when messages that are no longer needed are to be removed or journaled (copied) to a separate storage location outside the mailbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397180">managed content settings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961101">മാനേജുചെയ്‌ത ഉള്ളടക്ക സജ്ജീകരണങ്ങള്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6516_50772_489261"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of turning data into a stream of bits. Encoding is part of the serialization process that converts data into a stream of ones and zeros.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50772">encoding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489261">എന്‍‌കോഡുചെയ്യല്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6520_91124_489536"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An effect created by simple, repeating designs such as vertical or horizontal lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="91124">pattern</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489536">പാറ്റേണ്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6521_237794_1241149"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A test performed by a human.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237794">manual test</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241149">കരകൃത പരിശോധന</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6524_233565_1241150"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of combining the changes in two distinct branches of a source-controlled database.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233565">merge operation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241150">ലയന പ്രക്രിയ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6533_62030_1229958"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A postal address at which a person is normally resident.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="62030">home address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></t