termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2530658">ഉപഭോക്തൃ അനുഭവം മെച്ചപ്പെടുത്താനുള്ള പ്രോഗ്രാം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8251_170245_2530658"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft program that invites customers to provide Microsoft with more detailed information about how the software is used including the type and frequency of errors, software and hardware performance, and feature usage. This information is anonymous and voluntary, and is used strictly for the purposes of software development.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="170245">CEIP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2530658">ഉപഭോക്തൃ അനുഭവം മെച്ചപ്പെടുത്താനുള്ള പ്രോഗ്രാം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8257_115925_1961246"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or being a device that does not require support from another device or system, for example, a computer that is not connected to a network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115925">stand-alone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961246">പിന്തുണ ആവശ്യമില്ലാത്തത്</t