"partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1228975">ഗ്രേഡ്താഴ്ത്തുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="952_318124_489133"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To translate all the source code of a program from a high-level language into object code prior to execution of the program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318124">build</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489133">കംപൈല്‍ചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="952_318124_490583"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To translate all the source code of a program from a high-level language into object code prior to execution of the program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318124">build</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490583">ബില്‍ഡ്ചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="952_36555_489133"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To translate all the source code of a program from a high-level language into object code prior to execution of the program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36555">compile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489133">കംപൈല്‍ചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="952_36555_490583"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To translate all the source code of a program from a high-level language into object code prior to execution of the program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36555">compile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490583">ബില്‍ഡ്ചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9521_253747_2708546"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account provided in a local domain for a user whose regular account is not in a trusted domain. A local account cannot be used to log on interactively. Further, a local account created in one domain cannot be used in a trusted domain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="253747">local account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2708546">ലോക്കൽ അക്കൗണ്ട്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9525_187818_1241626"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A command such as Refactor.Rename, which is part of the process of improving your code by changing the internal structure of the code without changing its external behavior.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187818">refactoring operation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241626">പുനര്‍ ഘടകങ്ങളാക്കല്‍ പ്രക്രിയ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9534_258951_490268"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The degree of precision and exactness with which one entity represents another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="258951">fidelity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490268">ഫിഡെലിറ്റി</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9536_61276_489322"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">For a computer system, to be in an inactive state, but not shut off. When the computer is switched back on, the desktop is restored exactly as it was.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="61276">hibernate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489322">ശീതനിദ്രചെയ്യുക</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9543_415057_1877961"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A member of a dimension whose value is calculated at run time by using an expression. Calculated member values can be derived from the values of other members.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="415057">calculated member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877961">കണക്കാക്കിയ അംഗം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9547_177819_489984"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A document that contains general release information and late changes. It is one of the deliverables leading to the release readiness approved milestone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="177819">release notes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489984">പ്രകാശന കുറിപ്പുകള്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="955_237234_1241176"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A partitioning of the life of a product into phases that guide the project from identifying customer needs through product retirement.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237234">life cycle model</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241176">ജീവചക്ര മോഡല്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9552_266832_1877944"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A secondary data source that is accessible to users who fill out forms offline. When a user is online, data from the data source is stored on the user’s computer so that it can appear in controls when the form is offline.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="266832">offline data source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1877944">ഓഫ്‌ലൈന്‍ ഡാറ്റ ഉറവിടം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9555_139836_1229743"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field you can create. A custom field can be a blank, combination, or formula field.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="139836">custom field</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1229743">കസ്റ്റംമേഖല</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="956_147726_1241177"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of communication between different operating system processes, regardless of whether they are on the same computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="147726">remoting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1241177">വിദൂരമാക്കല്‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9561_179696_489996"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A selection technique that involves dragging out a bounding outline (also referred to as a marquee) to define the selected objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="179696">region selection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="489996">പ്രദേശ തിരഞ്ഞെടുപ്പ്</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9566_323154_490705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To start or reset a computer by turning the power on, by pressing a reset button on the computer case, or by issuing a software command to restart.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="323154">start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="490705">ആരംഭം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="957_117447_2323486"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Dialog from film or video displayed on the screen (usually at the bottom) and typically used to provide translation from a foreign language.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="117447">subtitle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ml-IN"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2323486">സഹശീര്‍ഷകം</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9570_3951_1241627"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The engine at the core of managed code execution. The runtime supplies managed code with services such as cross-language integration, code access security, object lifetime management, and debugging and profiling support.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3951">common language runtime</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNu